## Examples

```shell
pixi audit ignore CVE-2023-0464 --reason "not reachable in this deployment"
pixi audit ignore CVE-2026-7777 --until-fixed # (1)!
pixi audit ignore CVE-2023-0464 --package openssl --ecosystem conda-forge --up-to-version 3.1.0
pixi audit ignore --package vendored-thing --expired-at 2026-12-31 # (2)!
```

1. Ignore the advisory while no fixed release newer than the locked version is reported in the package's own ecosystem.
2. Ignore every advisory of the package through the end of 2026, in UTC.

